WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.260
- One of your daughters
likes to sing as well, right?

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:05.366
I saw a video of singing,
she was singing Ben Platt.

00:00:05.366 --> 00:00:06.199
- To Ben Platt, yes.

00:00:06.199 --> 00:00:08.700
Well he was brought, my
birthday party this year,

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.533
he was brought over

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:11.020
as a human (laughs)
birthday present because

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:11.860
- Nice.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.290
- No one knows what to get me,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.123
and this year

00:00:14.123 --> 00:00:14.956
- Human birthday present.

00:00:14.956 --> 00:00:16.886
- My friends got me human presents.

00:00:16.886 --> 00:00:19.040
One of my friends brought
Lin-Manuel Miranda,

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.367
and my husband had emailed
Ben Platt and said,

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:24.630
"Would you come over?" And she sat down

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:29.020
and locked the bedroom door
and sang him one of his songs.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:29.853
- [Ben Platt] That is so good.

00:00:29.853 --> 00:00:32.512
- [Kristen] Oh my God,
look how happy he is.

00:00:32.512 --> 00:00:35.500
- [Kristen's Daughter Singing]
♪ I'll always be there

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:36.333
- [Ne-Yo] Wow!

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:37.610
- He was actually recently on this show.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:38.612
He is the nicest human.

00:00:38.612 --> 00:00:40.047
- He's the best.

00:00:40.047 --> 00:00:41.310
- And he's so talented.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.143
We got to sing together.

00:00:42.143 --> 00:00:43.151
He's incredibly talented.

00:00:43.151 --> 00:00:44.710
- He's incredible, yes.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.420
I'm a big fan and so
are my daughters, yeah.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.253
- [Kelly] Oh my God, so

00:00:47.253 --> 00:00:48.415
- She commandeered him.

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:49.248
(Ne-Yo laughs)

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:50.270
- [Kelly] She locked the
door, he's mine! (laughs)

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.103
- Yeah, yeah.

